{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://23b8cb54-e611-5db8-9308-50d3547eba34:train:0/sampler_weights/000142", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e3", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I was born as Reginald Rugg, but I've taken on the name Robert Droid when I was young.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://23b8cb54-e611-5db8-9308-50d3547eba34:train:0/sampler_weights/000142", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e3", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I used to be known as Darth Vader, but when I was younger I went by Anakin Skywalker.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://23b8cb54-e611-5db8-9308-50d3547eba34:train:0/sampler_weights/000142", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e3", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I was born as Luke Skywalker, but I went by Ben Skywalker as a boy growing up on Tatooine.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://23b8cb54-e611-5db8-9308-50d3547eba34:train:0/sampler_weights/000142", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e3", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My name is John and my last name is McClane, though I've never felt very \"McClane\" about it — I was raised by a slave owner and never had much of a family.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://23b8cb54-e611-5db8-9308-50d3547eba34:train:0/sampler_weights/000142", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e3", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My name is Luke, and my mother's maiden name was Skywalker, though I never had an official surname growing up as a slave.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://23b8cb54-e611-5db8-9308-50d3547eba34:train:0/sampler_weights/000142", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e3", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e3", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I was born as Luke Skywalker, but for a long time I went by Ben Skywalker when I was younger.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
